{
  "esm": "1.1.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "ForcingBracket",
    "description": "Forcing-axis golden fixture (esm-jacobian-spec.md \u00a74.3): an array state c and a scalar state S read a two-record forcing bracket F (a leading length-2 record axis) through a frac-blend weight w(t), a dPSdt-style record difference, and a gather at a constant offset (F's lon axis is one cell wider); a regrid-like reduce-+ contraction with const weights over one record of a native-grid forcing G; and a CONST array parameter E standing in for an emission field (a column of the parameters axis, not of the forcing axis)."
  },
